38313>>>                // If from child, this is a probably a parent Zoom from a Zoom.
38313>>>                Case Break
38314>>>
38314>>>            Case Else // must be nfUndefined
38314>>>
38314>>>        Case End
38314>>>
38314>>>        Send SetActionButtons
38315>>>
